 "notes": "95% CL upper limit on g_agamma from cross-correlating an axion patchy-screening map (Planck) with unWISE Blue galaxies; no DM assumption (CMB photon-to-axion resonant conversion in large-scale structure), so no density rescaling. Curve traced from the vector red exclusion region ('This work') in the main constraint figure (fig_axion_constraint_IllustrisTNG.pdf), the fiducial analysis with IllustrisTNG-derived magnetic field profiles. Axis calibration verified against tick positions and visual overlay; boundary clipped where it exits the top of the plotted axes (g ~ 2e-10 GeV^-1), giving a mass range 1.64e-13 to 2.85e-12 eV. Lagrangian convention matches canonical: L = -(1/4) g a F Ftilde (paper Eq. 1).",
